---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="About the Developer | Bare Bones SEO" description="Meet Aaron Charlton, founder of Charlton Digital and developer of the free, open-source Bare Bones SEO tools.">
  <section class="wrap about page-intro">
    <h1>About the developer</h1>
    <p class="lead">I'm Aaron Charlton, founder of <a href="https://charltondigital.com/">Charlton Digital</a> and the developer of Bare Bones SEO.</p>
    <img class="developer-photo" src="/developer-portrait.webp" alt="Aaron Charlton outdoors among the ponderosa pines near Flagstaff" width="180" height="228" decoding="async" />
    <p>I'm a marketing analyst and SEO practitioner. I've spent about two decades working with websites and search marketing, and I hold a PhD in marketing. I build tools around the problems I encounter doing SEO.</p>
    <p>I'm also comfortable working with code. During roughly eight years in academia, R was my primary tool for data analysis. Before that, I worked extensively with HTML and CSS and some JavaScript to build and maintain websites. Like many developers today, I use AI-assisted coding tools. I bring years of hands-on technical work, analytical experience, and practical SEO judgment to the process.</p>
    <p>I built Bare Bones SEO because I believe fundamental technical SEO settings shouldn't require a heavy optimization suite. Website owners and SEOs should be able to see the settings that matter, change them, and verify what their websites actually publish.</p>
    <p>The project has two open-source approaches: a lightweight <a href="/wordpress/">WordPress plugin</a> and a set of <a href="/ai-sites/">standards for AI-built websites</a> that work with existing coding agents. Neither is intended to replace SEO strategy or content decisions.</p>
    <p>I'm based near Flagstaff, Arizona. You can learn more about my work at <a href="https://aaroncharlton.com/">aaroncharlton.com</a>, or visit <a href="https://charltondigital.com/">Charlton Digital</a>.</p>
  </section>
</Base>
<style>
  .about{max-width:52rem;padding-bottom:var(--space-6)}
  h1{font-size:clamp(2.1rem,4.4vw,3.3rem);margin-bottom:var(--space-3)}
  p{color:var(--ink-soft);margin-bottom:1.2rem}
  .lead{font-size:1.2rem;color:var(--ink);line-height:1.6}
  .developer-photo{display:block;float:right;width:180px;height:228px;object-fit:cover;border-radius:10px;margin:.25rem 0 1.4rem 2rem}
  .about::after{content:"";display:block;clear:both}
  @media(max-width:36rem){.developer-photo{float:none;margin:0 0 1.5rem;width:180px;height:228px}}
</style>
